{"4951320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dinosaur Apocalypse", "steam_appid": 4951320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After humans resurrected dinosaurs, a prehistoric virus brought by the dinosaurs caused a mass extinction. Dinosaurs once again dominated the Earth, and humanity was nearly wiped out. You will play as a survivor, exploring the ruins of a desolate city, hunting, fishing, developing agriculture, building shelters and homes to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grand and magnificent post-apocalyptic city ruin scene, immersing you in the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports single-player and multiplayer modes; you can hunt dinosaurs and build homes with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich variety of realistic dinosaurs, simulating a vibrant natural ecosystem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet System: Feed, tame, and ride dinosaurs, ride them through the city, and battle other giant beasts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful and flexible building system: You can build various shelters and even skyscrapers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Motorcycle and car driving systems; freely roam the deserted roads of the post-apocalyptic city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich crafting system; you can craft various melee weapons and firearms and ammunition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming System: Grow various fruits and vegetables, sell your produce, or cook delicious food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking System: Collect supplies to create various delicious dishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing and swimming systems allow you to fish for various fish in ponds and lakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic day-night cycle and weather system simulate realistic weather changes in nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logging and mining, looting supplies, allow you to collect various resources for building and crafting.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After humans resurrected dinosaurs, a prehistoric virus brought by the dinosaurs caused a mass extinction. Dinosaurs once again dominated the Earth, and humanity was nearly wiped out. You will play as a survivor, exploring the ruins of a desolate city, hunting, fishing, developing agriculture, building shelters and homes to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grand and magnificent post-apocalyptic city ruin scene, immersing you in the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports single-player and multiplayer modes; you can hunt dinosaurs and build homes with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich variety of realistic dinosaurs, simulating a vibrant natural ecosystem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet System: Feed, tame, and ride dinosaurs, ride them through the city, and battle other giant beasts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful and flexible building system: You can build various shelters and even skyscrapers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Motorcycle and car driving systems; freely roam the deserted roads of the post-apocalyptic city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich crafting system; you can craft various melee weapons and firearms and ammunition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming System: Grow various fruits and vegetables, sell your produce, or cook delicious food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking System: Collect supplies to create various delicious dishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing and swimming systems allow you to fish for various fish in ponds and lakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic day-night cycle and weather system simulate realistic weather changes in nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logging and mining, looting supplies, allow you to collect various resources for building and crafting.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Dinosaurs took over the Earth, and humans were almost wiped out. How would you survive?", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Ukrainian, Russian, Bulgarian, Hungarian, Indonesian, Turkish, Greek, Norwegian, Czech, Japanese, Polish, Swedish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Romanian, Finnish, Dutch, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Vietnamese, Korean, Malay", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951320/e1a7c310ab52279e854b6c6d93817acdac171411/header.jpg?t=1788359789", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951320/14bd8eedccb8825fb74d6416d77587acdbf31b35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788359789", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951320/14bd8eedccb8825fb74d6416d77587acdbf31b35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788359789", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> INTEL CORE I5-8400 or AMD RYZEN 3 3300Ｘ<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 4GB or AMD Radeon RX 570 4GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> INTEL CORE I5-8700 or AMD RYZEN 5 3600Ｘ<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080Ti  or AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</st